# lucene-rust's own test dictionary: COMPOUNDRULE, CHECKCOMPOUNDPATTERN
# replacements, FORCEUCASE, phonetic data, split and mixed-case suggestions,
# trailing dots, and affix conditions with dashes, unclosed brackets and
# strips longer than their condition.
SET UTF-8
TRY esianrtolcdugmphbyfvkwz
WORDCHARS -.
KEY qwertyuiop|asdfghjkl|zxcvbnm
COMPOUNDMIN 1
ONLYINCOMPOUND c
COMPOUNDRULE 3
COMPOUNDRULE n*1t
COMPOUNDRULE n*mp
COMPOUNDRULE (y)(w)?(z)
COMPOUNDFLAG C
CHECKCOMPOUNDPATTERN 1
CHECKCOMPOUNDPATTERN o b z
FORCEUCASE U
REP 2
REP alot a_lot
REP ph f
BREAK 1
BREAK -

SFX A Y 2
SFX A   0     s          [a-c]
SFX A   0     er         [ae

SFX B Y 3
SFX B   abc   x          [ab]c
SFX B   y     ies        x
SFX B   y     ied        [^aeiou]z

PFX G Y 3
PFX G   ab    x          abc
PFX G   0     re         [^-]
PFX G   ab    y          [ab]

SFX H Y 1
SFX H   ing   e          [^aeiou]ing
